    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reconstruct densely sampled fossil and extant lineages and test whether ancestral and morphologically intermediate forms disappear as derived descendants diversify. Temporal overlap followed by decline of ancestors and intermediates supports the prediction; persistent ancestor-descendant coexistence weakens it.";
